{"seq":2,"slug":"score-entropy-sedd","title":"SEDD 与得分熵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/architectures/score-entropy-sedd","wordCount":1617,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"sedd-与得分熵\">SEDD 与得分熵</h1><p>连续扩散的全部威力，建立在一个叫「得分」的量上——数据分布对数密度的梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla_x \\log p(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。可文本是离散的，没有梯度，这套理论似乎注定与文本无缘。2023 年底的 SEDD（Discrete Diffusion Modeling by Estimating the Ratios of the Data Distribution）找到了离散世界里得分的对应物，并据此把困惑度压到能与 GPT-2 正面交锋的程度——这项工作拿下了 2024 年 ICML 最佳论文。这一篇讲清「得分熵」这个损失到底是什么，以及它与吸收态路线的分工。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SEDD 的核心洞察是：离散空间没有梯度，但有「相邻状态的概率比值」可以扮演得分的角色。对一个序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 和它的某个邻居 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>（只在一个位置不同），定义比值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{p(y)}{p(x)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>——它衡量「把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的某个 token 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 对应的 token，会让这个序列变得更可能还是更不可能」。这个比值就是离散版的得分，SEDD 训练一个网络 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_\\theta(x)_y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 去估计所有这样的比值。</p>\n<p>为了学这个比值，SEDD 提出**得分熵（score entropy）**损失。它是 Bregman 散度的一个特例，专门用来匹配正的比值量，形式上保证了损失非负、且在估计正确时取零。配合连续时间马尔可夫链（CTMC，见 <a href=\"../foundations/discrete-diffusion-basics\">离散扩散基础</a>），SEDD 用估计出的比值构造反向过程的速率矩阵，从而把噪声序列一步步还原成文本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[连续扩散依赖得分&lt;br/&gt;对数密度梯度] --&gt;|离散无梯度| B[找对应物]&#10;    B --&gt; C[相邻状态概率比值 p_y / p_x]&#10;    C --&gt; D[网络估计所有比值 s_theta]&#10;    D --&gt; E[得分熵损失&lt;br/&gt;Bregman 散度 匹配正比值]&#10;    E --&gt; F[非负 估计正确取零]&#10;    F --&gt; G[用比值构造 CTMC 反向速率矩阵]&#10;    G --&gt; H[反向采样还原文本]&#10;    I[吸收态噪声] -.可作前向.-&gt; G&#10;    J[均匀噪声] -.可作前向.-&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n    A[连续扩散依赖得分&lt;br/&gt;对数密度梯度] --&gt;|离散无梯度| B[找对应物]\n    B --&gt; C[相邻状态概率比值 p_y / p_x]\n    C --&gt; D[网络估计所有比值 s_theta]\n    D --&gt; E[得分熵损失&lt;br/&gt;Bregman 散度 匹配正比值]\n    E --&gt; F[非负 估计正确取零]\n    F --&gt; G[用比值构造 CTMC 反向速率矩阵]\n    G --&gt; H[反向采样还原文本]\n    I[吸收态噪声] -.可作前向.-&gt; G\n    J[均匀噪声] -.可作前向.-&gt; G</pre><p>下表把 SEDD 与 D3PM/MDLM 这条吸收态主线放在一起对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>SEDD（得分熵）</th>\n<th>D3PM / MDLM（吸收态）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学习目标</td>\n<td>估计相邻状态概率比值</td>\n<td>预测掩码位置原 token</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>损失</td>\n<td>得分熵（Bregman 散度）</td>\n<td>加权交叉熵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>理论母体</td>\n<td>离散版得分匹配</td>\n<td>变分下界 ELBO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声类型</td>\n<td>吸收态或均匀皆可</td>\n<td>通常吸收态 [MASK]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>似然成绩</td>\n<td>较 GPT-2 困惑度低，较旧扩散降 25%–75%</td>\n<td>与 GPT-2 接近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间一致性</td>\n<td>原生 CTMC，连续</td>\n<td>MDLM 也已连续化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"得分熵损失的直觉\">得分熵损失的直觉</h2><p>为什么要费劲估计「比值」而不直接像 MDLM 那样预测 token？理解这点要回到连续扩散的精神。在连续扩散里，反向过程由得分函数驱动，而得分匹配之所以成功，是因为它绕过了对配分函数（归一化常数）的估计——只需知道密度的相对变化方向。SEDD 把这个精神搬到离散域：比值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{p(y)}{p(x)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 同样不含配分函数（它在分子分母里约掉了），所以可以在不知道整个序列分布归一化常数的前提下学习。</p>\n<p>得分熵作为损失的精妙在于它是为「匹配正量」量身定做的。直接对比值做平方误差会有问题——比值跨越好几个数量级，平方误差会被大比值主导。得分熵用 Bregman 散度的结构，让损失对比值的尺度更鲁棒，且具备「真实比值处取最小、非负」的良好性质，这对训练稳定性至关重要。SEDD 论文证明，这个损失在适当条件下是负对数似然的上界，因此最小化它就是在最大化似然，理论闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能突破的意义\">性能突破的意义</h2><p>SEDD 的实测成绩是它影响力的来源。在可比模型规模下，SEDD 把困惑度较此前的语言扩散范式降低了 25% 到 75%，并且首次让一个扩散语言模型在标准基准上稳定优于同规模的 GPT-2。这不是小修小补——在 SEDD 之前，扩散语言模型在似然上与自回归差距明显，被普遍认为只是「有趣但不实用」；SEDD 第一次让「扩散能在核心语言建模指标上挑战自回归」成为可被严肃对待的命题。</p>\n<p>不过要把这个成绩放进正确的语境，见 <a href=\"../practice/benchmarks-vs-ar\">与自回归的对比评测</a>：SEDD 优化的得分熵是似然的上界，它报告的困惑度因此也是上界估计，与自回归的精确困惑度对比时需要审慎。SEDD 的真正贡献或许不在于「赢了 GPT-2 多少」，而在于它给离散扩散补上了与连续扩散对等的理论骨架，让后续工作有了坚实的数学立足点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与吸收态路线的关系与边界\">与吸收态路线的关系与边界</h2><p>SEDD 与 <a href=\"d3pm-absorbing-state\">D3PM 与吸收态</a> 并不是非此即彼。SEDD 是一套「学习目标」（估计比值的得分熵），而吸收态是一种「前向噪声」（怎么破坏文本）——二者可以组合：SEDD 既可以配吸收态噪声，也可以配均匀噪声。事实上，后续研究（如 2024 年那篇指出「掩码扩散其实是时间无关的掩码模型」的工作）逐渐揭示，吸收态掩码扩散的 MDLM 目标与 SEDD 在该噪声下的得分熵目标存在深刻联系，某些参数化下甚至等价。</p>\n<p>这意味着两条路线正在收敛。实践上，由于 MDLM 的加权交叉熵实现更简单、与现有 Transformer 训练基建更契合，规模化的扩散 LLM（LLaDA、Dream）多采用 MDLM 式目标；而 SEDD 的价值更多体现在理论分析与对均匀噪声等更一般噪声的支持上。划清边界：本篇只讲得分熵这一目标本身，至于它如何影响采样步数与质量，属于 <a href=\"../capabilities/parallel-decoding-sampling\">并行解码与采样</a>；如何与自回归公平比困惑度，属于实践章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SEDD 找到离散版「得分」——相邻状态概率比值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{p(y)}{p(x)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，绕过配分函数，对应连续扩散的得分匹配。</li>\n<li>得分熵损失基于 Bregman 散度，专为匹配正比值设计，非负、尺度鲁棒，是负对数似然的上界。</li>\n<li>实测把困惑度较旧扩散降 25%–75%，首次让扩散语言模型稳定优于同规模 GPT-2，是 2024 ICML 最佳论文。</li>\n<li>SEDD 是「学习目标」，吸收态是「前向噪声」，二者可组合且在掩码噪声下与 MDLM 深刻相关，两条路线正在收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>吸收态噪声的转移矩阵：<a href=\"d3pm-absorbing-state\">D3PM 与吸收态</a></li>\n<li>CTMC 与比值的母框架：<a href=\"../foundations/discrete-diffusion-basics\">离散扩散基础</a></li>\n<li>得分熵困惑度对比的陷阱：<a href=\"../practice/benchmarks-vs-ar\">与自回归的对比评测</a></li>\n<li>跨库：连续扩散的 score-based SDE 母体：<a href=\"../../diffusion-models/foundations/score-based-sde\">扩散模型 score-based SDE</a></li>\n<li>跨库：生成式建模的总体视角：<a href=\"../../diffusion-models/foundations/generative-modeling\">扩散模型 生成式建模</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SEDD 与得分熵","id":"sedd-与得分熵"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"得分熵损失的直觉","id":"得分熵损失的直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"性能突破的意义","id":"性能突破的意义"},{"level":2,"text":"与吸收态路线的关系与边界","id":"与吸收态路线的关系与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"D3PM 与吸收态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/architectures/d3pm-absorbing-state"},"next":{"title":"连续嵌入空间扩散","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/architectures/continuous-embedding-diffusion"}}